q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 66 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12.5 TL (Collaboration between business components happens through direct in-process method calls rather than serialized REST or) Tj T* (gRPC calls over a network. A driver's search or reservation request passes through authentication, station search or reservation) Tj T* (logic, and data access within one runtime, avoiding the network hops and serialization overhead of distributed services. This) Tj T* (supports the 2.0-second search target in NFR-002, together with database indexes on location and connector type in the Data) Tj T* (tier. Under higher load, the stateless Business Logic tier can be replicated behind a load balancer while sharing the same) Tj T* (relational database.) Tj T* ET
Q
