BT 1 0 0 1 0 41 Tm /F1 9 Tf 12.5 TL (A layered deployment scales as a single unit, whereas microservices allow independent scaling per function. For a reservation) Tj T* -0.078801 Tw (platform whose critical path is a consistent booking transaction, we accept this limitation. If live charger telemetry ingestion grows) Tj T* 0 Tw (large enough to need independent scaling, it can be extracted into a separate service behind the existing tier interfaces without) Tj T* (redesigning the rest of the system.) Tj T* ET
